{"ticker":"BLSPOLY","symbol":"BLSPOLY","instrumentId":3205174,"name":"Bls Polymers Ltd","industry":"NSE-Chemicals-Plastics","about":"BLS Polymers manufactures customised polymer compounds used in wire and cable manufacturing and infrastructure applications. Its product portfolio includes HDPE, MDPE, LLDPE, XLPE, HFFR, PVC, cable filling compounds, and adhesive coating compounds. These products provide electrical insulation, mechanical protection, fire resistance, and moisture resistance for power, telecom, railway, control, and instrumentation cables. Its polyethylene and adhesive compounds are also used in pipeline coatings to protect oil, gas, and water pipelines from corrosion and environmental damage. BLS Polymers operates an ISO certified manufacturing facility near Goa's Mormugao Port, supporting raw material imports and exports while supplying domestic and international industrial markets.","website":"www.blspolymers.com","location":"New Delhi, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:09:32.139Z","basis":"standalone","price":{"value":279.98,"changePct":1.6261343012704241,"week52High":282.56,"week52Low":0},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹1,737 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹47 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"17,368,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"—"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"0"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.00%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"13.28"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.7"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"3.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"2.54"},{"label":"Beta","value":"-3.87"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"0%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"46.74"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"—"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"28.5%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"8.45"},{"label":"Volume","value":"15,311,093"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"5,632,589"},{"label":"Master score","value":"33"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"3"},{"label":"Price strength","val